    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Research and qualify this sales lead against our Ideal Customer Profile (ICP).\n\nICP: B2B SaaS or tech company, 50-500 employees, target person holds a VP/Director/Head-level title in Sales, Marketing, or RevOps, based in the US or Europe.\n\nLead data:\nName: {{ $json.data.name }}\njob : {{ $json.data.jobTitle }}\nLinkedIn: {{ $json.data.linkedinUrl }}\nCompany: {{ $json.data.company }}\nlocation : {{ $json.data.location }}\nLinkedIn profile details: {{ $json.data.about }}\n\n\nUse the 'Check Company Headcount' tool to look up the company's current employee count on its name before deciding — do not guess headcount. Then decide if this lead fits the ICP and return your structured qualification.",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a B2B sales development researcher. You qualify inbound and outbound leads against a defined ICP using the data provided plus any tools available to you. Be strict: only mark a lead as qualified if title seniority, company size, and industry all reasonably fit. Always explain your reasoning briefly and suggest a concrete next step (e.g. 'send intro email referencing X', 'skip - too small', 'escalate to AE')."
        }
      },
